---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SignupForm from '../../components/SignupForm.astro';
---
<Base title="Subscribe" description="Get the Qualified Ledes weekly roundup: the marketing news that mattered, what to do about it, and a free resource.">
  <main id="content" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start">
    <div class="prose" style="flex:1 1 420px">
      <h1 class="display">Join the early list</h1>
      <p>A weekly email is on the way: the stories that mattered most for small businesses, nonprofits and marketers, a clear next step for each, and a free resource. Join now and you will get the first issue and early access to free templates.</p>
      <p>In the meantime, the site updates every weekday. Make it your paper on the <a href="/">front page</a>, or follow along by <a href="/stories.xml">RSS</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex:1 1 320px"><SignupForm id="subscribe-page" heading="Join the list" /></div>
  </main>
</Base>
